45.0 661.39 Td (1.1 Project Overview) Tj ET
Q
q BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.24 rg
45.0 647.39 Td (**Scholar AI** is a full-stack, intelligent web platform designed to democratize higher) Tj
45.0 635.89 Td (education financial aid for Indian college and university students. The platform bridges the) Tj
45.0 624.39 Td (information gap between thousands of public, corporate CSR \(Corporate Social) Tj
45.0 612.89 Td (Responsibility\), non-governmental, and state-funded scholarship schemes and the students) Tj
45.0 601.39 Td (who desperately qualify for them.) Tj
ET Q
q BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.24 rg
45.0 585.89 Td (By combining **live web search \(Serper Google API\)**, **automated document scraping &) Tj
45.0 574.39 Td (heuristic normalization \(BeautifulSoup4\)**, a **deterministic 9-point rule evaluation) Tj
45.0 562.89 Td (engine**, and an **application lifecycle tracker**, Scholar AI replaces fragmented, outdated) Tj
45.0 551.39 Td (blog posts with transparent, personalized, and actionable scholarship recommendations.) Tj
ET Q
q
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.18 0.24 0.38 rg
45.0 535.89 Td (1.2 Problem Statement) Tj ET
Q
q BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.24 rg
45.0 521.89 Td (In India, hundreds of crores in scholarship funds lapse or go unclaimed each academic year) Tj
45.0 510.39 Td (due to five systemic failure points:) Tj
ET Q
q
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.39 0.40 0.95 rg
51.0 494.89 Td (1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.24 rg
67.0 494.89 Td (**Severe Information Asymmetry:** Schemes are scattered across Central Government) Tj
67.0 483.39 Td (portals \(NSP\), State welfare portals \(Mahadbt, e-Kalyan, OASIS\), corporate CSR) Tj
67.0 471.89 Td (trusts \(Tata, Reliance, Infosys, HDFC, Aditya Birla\), and private NGOs.) Tj
ET Q
q
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.39 0.40 0.95 rg
51.0 457.39 Td (2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.24 rg
67.0 457.39 Td (**Ambiguous & Complex Eligibility Criteria:** Eligibility notices feature dense legal) Tj
67.0 445.89 Td (and academic criteria: income ceilings \(often specified in Lakhs per annum\),) Tj
67.0 434.39 Td (caste/social category tiers \(General, OBC, SC, ST, EWS\), domicile restrictions,) Tj
67.0 422.89 Td (minimum cut-offs \(sometimes CGPA on a 10-point scale, sometimes percentage\), age) Tj
67.0 411.39 Td (caps, gender quotas, and specific degree/course restrictions.) Tj
ET Q
q
