51.0 396.89 Td (3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.24 rg
67.0 396.89 Td (**Stale Information & Fraudulent Portals:** Many popular educational portals list) Tj
67.0 385.39 Td (expired scholarships with obsolete deadlines or host ad-heavy clickbait redirects) Tj
67.0 373.89 Td (designed to harvest student contact details without offering direct application links.) Tj
ET Q
q
