67.0 359.39 Td (**Lack of Centralized Tracking:** Once a student discovers a scholarship, managing) Tj
67.0 347.89 Td (document submission, application deadlines, status tracking \(Applied, Under Review,) Tj
67.0 336.39 Td (Awarded\), and renewal timelines is completely manual.) Tj
