BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.24 rg
67.0 321.89 Td (**Opaque "Black-Box" Recommendations:** Typical AI or search systems return a list of) Tj
67.0 310.39 Td (links without explaining *why* the user is or is not eligible. A student rejected for) Tj
67.0 298.89 Td (being Rs. 10,000 over an income ceiling receives no transparent feedback.) Tj
